<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0477_T05PC0101_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">North of Lavender is Rock Tunnel.\rGo through it to get to the Power\nPlant. Bring a flashlight. And a\fhomie.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0477_T05PC0101_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">There’s a radio show that play\nPoké Flute music.\rOh? Your radio need a EXPN Card\nto pick it up.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0477_T05PC0101_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">If the Power Plant ain’t runnin’, the\nMagnet Train don’t run neither...\rAnd the Radio Station can’t\nbroadcast... And my fridge off. My\fFOOD, bro.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0477_T05PC0101_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Radio Station Director was SO\nhappy.\rThey back on air ’cause the Power\nPlant runnin’ smooth. And my fridge\fback on.</language>
	</row>
</body>
